# Footprint
# =================================================================================================
# Skips the speech (SODA), on-device-translation (TranslateKit) and WASM-TTS components for any
# profile launched with --lobium-fp-config. Measured on 152.0.7977.42: they are 792 MB of the 824 MB
# a fresh profile downloads, and a profile carrying all of them is indistinguishable from one that
# never did (getVoices() 0, Translator undefined, in both). Every profile is its own
# --user-data-dir, so the saving is per profile. Deliberately narrower than
# --disable-component-update, which also drops the ~32 MB of CRLSet / First-Party Sets / Privacy
# Sandbox / Origin Trials that DO change web-visible behaviour.
perf/skip-heavy-components.patch

